Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2.5. Dimension list instead of association", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"5a3691c2-92c3-448b-9a06-84854522224f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "When indices have not yet been bound to arrays, the hypergraph constructor \
also accepts a positional ",
 StyleBox["_List", "Code"],
 " of dimensions in place of an ",
 StyleBox["Association", "Code"],
 ". The dimensions are paired with the union of integer index labels in \
sorted order: the first dimension is assigned to the smallest index, the \
second to the next, and so on. This is the most compact way to specify a \
symbolic skeleton when you do not care about index names."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e427146b-cb4c-4484-af9f-8b9fb963895f"],

