Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Inspect the hyperedge structure. Each contracted bond appears as a shared \
label between neighboring sites \[LongDash] labels 1, 2, and 3 link \
successive pairs. The physical legs (labels 5 through 8) appear only once \
each and remain free.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d2b26890-90b9-4a01-b747-d62fc54822c0"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

