Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3.4. PEPS on a 2D grid", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"f4220544-0b6e-4dfa-8f8e-47814f2b7897"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "PEPS \[LongDash] projected entangled pair states \[LongDash] lives on a 2D \
grid. The first argument is ",
 StyleBox["{rows, cols}", "Code"],
 ". Each site has up to four bond legs (one to each grid neighbor) plus a \
single physical leg; boundary and corner sites have correspondingly fewer \
bonds. The labeling encodes the (row, column) coordinates and the \
physical-leg range in separate integer bands (hundreds for rows, thousands \
for physical legs in this example) so the resulting hyperedge list stays \
readable."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"12ed61e6-1ad2-4d91-b8d4-572c15d0ccf5"],

